WEBVTT

00:03:57.871 --> 00:04:00.663
a deeply conservative position.

00:04:00.996 --> 00:04:04.829
That is, it says let's accept
people's condition as it is

00:04:04.829 --> 00:04:08.913
and let's make people feel better about
their unchanging condition.

00:04:10.204 --> 00:04:14.038
You know, there has been some critique of
positive psychology along those lines.

00:04:14.079 --> 00:04:16.496
I'm not I'm not innovating here.

00:04:17.538 --> 00:04:22.871
But I think that focusing on
changing circumstances

00:04:22.954 --> 00:04:29.204
and dealing directly with misery is more
important and is a worthy objective

00:04:29.204 --> 00:04:33.704
for society than making people feel
better about their situation.